    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nSometimes it is useful to live-preview input changes, for example when implementing `/`-like search. We can use `CmdlineChanged`, but this is not an option with custom input implementations.\n\nShould the same apply to `vim.ui.select`?\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nOne of:\n\n```lua\nvim.ui.input({ on_change = function(input) end }, function(input) end)\n```\n\n```lua\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"UiInputChanged\", {\n  callback = function()\n  end,\n})\n```",
    "closed_at": null,
    "closed_by": null,
